    <section class="empire-glance" id="at-a-glance" aria-labelledby="glance-title">
      <div class="empire-glance-main"><h2 class="empire-glance-title" id="glance-title">At a glance</h2><ul><li>The Republic was proclaimed on 14 April 1931, two days after republicans won a landslide in the municipal elections, and King <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/alfonso-xiii">Alfonso XIII</a> went into exile.</li><li>The Constitution of 1931 ended <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/catholicism">Catholicism</a>'s status as the state religion, allowed divorce, extended the vote to women and gave every region the right to autonomy.</li><li>A military uprising on 17 July 1936 began the <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/spanish-civil-war">Spanish Civil War</a>, in which an estimated half a million people died, and the Republic was dissolved on 1 April 1939.</li></ul></div>
      <aside class="empire-dyk"><p class="empire-dyk-title">Did you know?</p><p>In the Revolution of 1934 the miners of <a class="enc-link" href="/encyclopedia/asturias">Asturias</a>, in the towns they held, officially declared a proletarian revolution and abolished regular money; the rising lasted two weeks before the army crushed it.</p></aside>
    </section>

